[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1415","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1415.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1228","title":"多款调制解调器 AT 命令远程代码执行漏洞","description":"部分调制解调器未实现或配置了零秒的 AT 命令保护间隔（guard time），导致远程攻击者可通过在 ICMP 数据包、电子邮件主题、IRC 命令等网络流量中嵌入 \"+++\" 转义序列，绕过正常拨号保护机制，向目标调制解调器发送 ATH、ATH0 等任意 AT 命令，实现挂断、重拨等非授权操作。该漏洞影响多款未正确配置保护间隔的调制解调器设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。厂商建议启用或延长 guard time 参数以防止 \"+++\" 序列被误解析为命令转义符。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1228"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-09-27T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:59Z","remediation":"在 Modem 的初始化字符串中添加 S12=50（设置退出数据模式的 guard time 为 500 毫秒），同时在 S-Register 中将 S2 设置为 255 以禁用 +++ 转义序列。为关键系统使用的 Modem 创建专用防火墙规则，过滤掉包含 +++ 序列的 ICMP 和 SMTP 流量作为深层防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90695973308453&w=2","http://www.macintouch.com/modemsecurity.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3320","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/7e589afaae66d8467d0dac73b894edb3c19e638d/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Linux/Exploit/CVE-1999-1228.yara","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1228.json","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Linux/CVE-1999-1228/Exploit_Linux_CVE-1999-1228_A_xp.yar","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1228","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1228.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1228.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xqv9-mm7j-xwfh/GHSA-xqv9-mm7j-xwfh.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/petikvx/VirusShare_ELF/blob/d7c50d4e58f7548429da993c743efe8a9f3e0fee/TREEMALWARE"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1415.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1307","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1307.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1054","title":"FLEXlm许可管理器远程服务器关闭漏洞","description":"FLEXlm许可证管理器（如6.0d版本）的默认配置存在严重的安全缺陷。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送包含lmdown命令的特制数据包，向目标FLEXlm许可服务器发起关闭请求。由于该命令的认证机制仅基于客户端自称具有root权限的信任模型，攻击者只需构造符合协议格式的请求报文，即可远程终止许可证管理服务，造成合法用户无法获取授权，进而导致依赖该许可的软件产品无法正常运行。该漏洞影响运行FLEXlm许可证管理器的各类工程软件、CAD工具及商业应用程序服务器，攻击者无需获取目标系统权限即可实现服务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1054"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-09-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:36Z","remediation":"升级 FLEXlm 许可管理器至 7.0 及以上版本（建议 11.x 最新版）。在新版中编辑许可服务配置文件，移除或不授予 `lmdown` 权限（使用 `lmgrd -z` 禁止远程关闭，或在 options 文件中删除 ADMIN 对应的关闭权限），并将 lmgrd 监听端口（默认 27000-27009）通过防火墙限制为仅允许可信内网 IP 访问，禁止公网直接连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90675672323825&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dde4d96d7c1eff197b9a15817af615500736afa7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1054.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1054","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1054.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d0833866f347223eab80ef68cc3e2461a4e724d/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1054.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ce77465efdf58fc31a7a0bc8c83705be48abcedf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xxf6-r989-348x/GHSA-xxf6-r989-348x.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1054.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88502/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5490498c-71c5-40a2-8992-ceaa9e54be84.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/1216817b1ffea775aa09a87ad4eb5d4ec3f12b57/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1307.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1434","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1434.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1265","title":"Seattle Lab Software SLmail 3.1 SMTP 命令处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Seattle Lab Software 出品的 SLmail 3.1 及更早版本的 SMTP 服务组件存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器的 25 号端口发送以左括号 \"(\" 开头的畸形命令参数，例如 SEND、(、VRFY、(、EXPN、(、MAIL FROM、(、RCPT TO、( 等，导致 SMTP 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 SLmail 3.1 及之前所有版本，攻击复杂度低，且无需任何用户交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1265"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-09-22T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:04Z","remediation":"SLmail 已停止维护多年，建议迁移至仍在安全更新的邮件服务器（如 Exchange、Postfix 等）。临时缓解措施：在 SMTP 代理或防火墙层面过滤以左括号开头的 SMTP 命令参数，或限制端口 25 的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90649892424117&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=90650438826447&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1664","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bab2ad77526cf53e031dbf06b248b9bb97c66bc2/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1265.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1265","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1265.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1265.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/491d1a908ffff7b174e17aaac4d0207c13405fa7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-68wf-hv6w-35mw/GHSA-68wf-hv6w-35mw.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87811/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1265.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-1999.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1434.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1228","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1228.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1020","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16371,\"outputTokens\":31,\"totalTokens\":16402}}","description":"Novell NetWare 4.1 及 4.11（含 SP5B 补丁）在安装 NDS（Novell Directory Services）5.99 版本时，默认赋予未认证客户端对整个目录树的读取（Read）权限。远程攻击者在无需身份认证的情况下，即可利用系统自带的 CX.EXE 与 NLIST.EXE 等工具连接目标目录树，枚举并读取其中的用户、用户组及其他可读对象等敏感信息。该漏洞影响所有部署了 NDS 5.99 的 Novell NetWare 4.1/4.11 服务器，攻击者仅需网络可达目标服务端口并能运行上述客户端工具即可实施信息泄露，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1020"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-09-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:32Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Novell NetWare 5.0 或更高版本（已停止支持），或应用 Novell 发布的 NDS 修补程序（如 NW411SP6A.EXE 及后续补丁）。若无法升级，建议通过防火墙限制 524/TCP 端口仅允许受信任管理网段访问，禁用 CX.EXE 和 NLIST.EXE 客户端工具的网络访问权限，并配置 NDS ACL 移除 [Public] 对树对象的 [Read] 权限，仅授权管理员账户访问敏感对象属性。建议尽快迁移至现代目录服务（如 Microsoft Active Directory 或 OpenLDAP）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90613355902262&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/484","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1364","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19365","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2126251525a2d370ea93bd7affc3a9b71b419b4c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1020.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1020","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1020.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7aedbd0209e609a1924ad29a8dda684737576137/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1020.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5d945305f2cad48b7bb06af582393a58c31555d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q937-qhpq-5w36/GHSA-q937-qhpq-5w36.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/nds_web_based_browsing.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1020.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/484/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1228.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0147","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0147.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0056","title":"Sun Solaris ping 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SunOS/Solaris 系统中 ping 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地用户通过向 ping 程序提交特制参数可触发缓冲区溢出，从而获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SunOS 4.x 及 Solaris 2.x 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高危。攻击者需拥有本地系统普通用户权限方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0056"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-09-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:28Z","remediation":"立即安装 Sun 官方提供的对应补丁（如 SunOS 5.x 和 Solaris 2.x 的推荐安全补丁集）。如无法打补丁，可临时移除 ping 程序的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/sbin/ping），以消除本地提权风险。建议升级至不受影响的 Solaris 版本或迁移至受支持的 Oracle Solaris 发行版。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/174"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0147.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1220","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1220.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0897","title":"iChat ROOMS Webserver 目录遍历漏洞","description":"iChat ROOMS Webserver 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 路径中使用 ../ 序列绕过访问限制，读取服务器上任意文件。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，可导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0897"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-09-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该漏洞源于 iChat ROOMS Webserver 对用户输入路径过滤不严，攻击者可通过 ../ 序列遍历目录读取任意文件。由于该产品已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器软件（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx），并在应用层对用户请求路径进行规范化校验，拒绝包含 ../ 或空字节等特殊字符的请求。同时配置 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截目录遍历攻击模式作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=90538488231977&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1220.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1305","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1305.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1048","title":"GNU Bash 提示符目录名处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"GNU Bash 在某个版本中存在缺陷，当使用包含 \\w（当前工作目录）的 PS1 提示符变量时，若当前目录名称异常长（例如用户切换到一个超大目录名），bash 会错误地处理该目录名并在生成密码提示符时发生拒绝服务，导致 shell 挂起或消耗大量资源而无法正常响应。攻击者在共享或多用户环境中可构造超长目录名诱导受害者进入，从而使其交互式 shell 不可用。该漏洞影响本地交互场景，需受害者处于该异常目录下方可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1048"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1998-09-05T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 bash 至修复该缺陷的 2.0.1 及以上版本（Debian 用户执行 apt-get update && apt-get install bash）。临时缓解措施：在 /etc/profile 及用户配置中将 PS1 中的 \\w 改为 \\W 或直接移除 \\w 选项，避免将超大目录名插入密码提示，并限制普通用户对公共目录的写权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602746719555&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/1998/19980909","http://www.osvdb.org/8345","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/10542","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3414"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1305.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1217","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1217.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0871","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 跨帧导航信息泄露漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.0 及 4.01 版本存在跨帧安全漏洞（Cross Frame Navigate），远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，利用浏览器跨帧导航机制绕过同源策略限制，读取目标用户本地文件系统中的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上的 IE 4.0/4.01 版本，攻击者需诱使用户访问恶意网站，无需身份认证即可实施攻击，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0871"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-09-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:13Z","remediation":"立即升级 Internet Explorer 至 5.01 及以上版本，或改用 Microsoft Edge/Chrome/Firefox 等现代浏览器。IE 4.0 已停止支持且存在大量未修复漏洞，不应继续使用。如因兼容性必须使用旧版 IE，建议启用 Internet Explorer 增强安全配置并禁用 ActiveX 脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/7837","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1998/ms98-013","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3668","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/42b5b7a8a9b34b1b292b9bfd27242e499ccb6cb9/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0871.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0871","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0871.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/21d84550d4f5d6b78cac9f7c41b1b20a874c9f15/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0871.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d94ad47d0f2016e121b6d251f490e890714f8916/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r7j6-qphw-hmhw/GHSA-r7j6-qphw-hmhw.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0871.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000362.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88092/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1217.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1217.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1217.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1226","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1226.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0930","title":"wwwboard 远程攻击者删除留言板文章漏洞","description":"wwwboard 是一款基于 Perl 的 Web 留言板程序，存在输入验证缺陷。远程攻击者可通过向脚本提交特制的畸形参数，绕过权限检查直接删除留言板中的任意文章，导致数据完整性受损。攻击无需身份认证，利用难度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0930"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1998-09-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"wwwboard 已停止维护，建议迁移至其他受支持的留言板解决方案。如无法替换，应限制对 wwwboard 脚本的网络访问权限，仅允许可信 IP 访问，并配置 Web 服务器过滤畸形请求参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T02:05:55Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1795","http://www.worldwidemart.com/scripts/faq/wwwboard/q5.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2344"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1226.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1132","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1132.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0779","title":"HP-UX SharedX recserv 程序拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP-UX 操作系统的 SharedX 组件中的 recserv 程序存在拒绝服务漏洞。未经认证的远程攻击者可通过向 recserv 服务端口发送特制网络请求，导致该服务崩溃或停止响应，影响 HP-UX 系统上 SharedX 功能的正常使用。该漏洞无需身份验证即可远程触发，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0779"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"1998-09-03T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 HP 安全公告 HPSBUX9810-086 中对应的 PHSS 补丁集。临时缓解措施：在防火墙或 TCP Wrappers 中限制对 recserv 服务端口的访问，仅允许受信任主机连接；如无需使用 SharedX 功能，建议直接禁用该服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9810-086"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1132.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1147","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1147.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0792","title":"路由 ROUTERmate 默认 SNMP 社区名称漏洞","description":"ROUTERmate 路由器设备使用了默认的 SNMP 团体名（community name），未进行修改。SNMP 协议依靠团体名进行简单的身份认证，由于该默认团体名公开且未变更，未经身份认证的远程攻击者只要能够网络访问目标设备的 SNMP 服务（通常为 UDP 161 端口），即可利用该默认团体名与该设备建立会话，进而读取设备信息或发送写请求修改其配置（如更改路由、DNS 或管理设置）。该漏洞影响所有使用出厂默认配置的 ROUTERmate 设备，攻击无需本地权限或用户交互，危害程度中等，建议管理员立即修改默认 SNMP 团体名并限制访问来源。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0792"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-09-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:04Z","remediation":"立即修改 ROUTERmate 默认 SNMP 社区字符串为强密码，并在防火墙/ACL 限制仅允许可信管理 IP 访问 SNMP 端口（UDP 161/162）；若不再使用 SNMP 管理功能，建议在设备配置中完全禁用 SNMP 服务。由于该产品已停止维护，无可用升级版本，建议尽快替换为受厂商支持的网络设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www2.merton.ox.ac.uk/~security/rootshell/0022.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0283d468fcc07a0a091bff7d6aca02552e8d0048/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0792.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0792","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0792.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f7f250b0cc5cc23741447612a2f182f04c36db78/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0792.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7c8j-r54x-ccvc/GHSA-7c8j-r54x-ccvc.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2014/gb_snmp_get_community.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0792.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154200_154300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000360.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4436c134-ab03-458c-bf2d-1dc4dfe83278.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1147.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0517","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0517.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0310","title":"HP-UX SSH 访问控制漏洞","description":"SSH 1.2.25 在 HP-UX 系统上存在访问控制缺陷，当系统添加新用户账户时，攻击者可通过 SSH 服务绕过认证直接访问这些新创建的账户，导致未授权访问。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 上运行的 SSH 1.2.25 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。漏洞源于用户账户创建后的默认配置未能正确限制访问权限，远程攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞获取系统访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0310"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-09-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:07Z","remediation":"升级至 OpenSSH（推荐 3.0 以上版本），禁用 SSH 1 协议，仅启用 SSH 2 协议。HP-UX 用户应安装 Hewlett-Packard 官方 SSH 安全补丁，或在系统层面通过 inetd.conf 禁用 SSH 服务，改用 telnet（如必要）并配合 hosts.allow/deny 限制访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0310","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d39c6fc359564f87c4fbc1b2c3e7c679c878fdd9/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0310.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0310","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0310.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db45dbc75ff0264d63b603291e4a83d7361bd7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0310.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/79c2cf4630fcc44f2632735de08432a07cfaf204/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6pm3-f7gw-pq5v/GHSA-6pm3-f7gw-pq5v.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0310.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82268/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d1259ae4-fae5-4ac0-a1f4-f0df5a94db65.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0517.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0502","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0502.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0302","title":"Sun Solaris FTP 客户端远程命令执行漏洞","description":"SunOS/Solaris 系统的 FTP 客户端存在命令执行漏洞，恶意 FTP 服务器可通过向客户端返回特制的响应数据包，诱使目标系统执行任意命令。攻击者无需认证即可远程触发该漏洞，完全控制受影响系统的 FTP 客户端进程。该漏洞影响 SunOS/Solaris 系列操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，建议用户及时升级相关补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0302"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-09-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:06Z","remediation":"建议升级 SunOS/Solaris 至厂商修复版本（如 Solaris 2.6 补丁 105490-05 及更高），或使用替代 FTP 客户端（如 OpenBSD ftp、lftp）替换默认 /usr/bin/ftp。若无法升级，可在 ftp 客户端环境变量 FTPMODE 设为 passive 降低风险，同时限制出站 FTP 连接至可信服务器，并在网络层面阻止连接恶意外部 FTP 服务器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/176"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0502.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1458","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1458.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1292","title":"Kolban Webcam32 Web管理功能缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Kolban Webcam32 4.8.3及更早版本的Web管理功能中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向Web管理界面发送超长URL触发缓冲区溢出，导致内存破坏，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。此漏洞无需身份验证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1292"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1998-09-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Kolban Webcam32 4.8.4 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。由于该产品已停止维护多年，建议迁移至仍在安全更新的替代产品，或至少限制 Web 管理界面仅允许受信任内网 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T11:03:15Z","references":["http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise7.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1366"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1458.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1458.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0332","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0332.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0162","title":"多厂商 FTP 服务器 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 访问控制列表（ACL）的\"established\"关键字用于匹配已建立 TCP 连接的回程流量，但其实现存在安全绕过漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标设备发送设置了 ACK 或 RST 标志位的特制 TCP 数据包，绕过 ACL 过滤规则，非授权访问受保护的内部网络资源。该漏洞影响多款 Cisco 路由器及交换机设备的 IOS 系统，CVSS v2 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0162"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1998-09-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"1998-09-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至不受影响版本。若无法升级，避免在 ACL 中单独依赖 established 关键词作为唯一过滤条件，应结合具体端口/协议/方向的多层访问控制规则，并部署防火墙进行深度包检测（stateful inspection）以防止伪造 ACK 包的绕过攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0332.toml"}]